    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Stars do not Lie, and they have chosen You. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you answer Their call?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Become a Star-Coat, a protector of the universe who seeks out danger wherever it is and eliminates it. Wield your COAT, a customizable walker that turns you into a one person army. With your COAT and weapons, traverse through shifting dungeons and defeat the bosses that command the enemies of the Stars. Each run is different from the last so be prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/7dd3708e3640e26122dc496b5ec9bdd2.avif?t=1752784091\" width=640 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Stars are full of those who want to claim Them for themselves. Show them They do not belong to those seeking to conquer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight on the ground as a pilot, nimble and light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/dc14aad121d84e43378518cc432f87c9.poster.avif?t=1752784091\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/dc14aad121d84e43378518cc432f87c9.webm?t=1752784091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/dc14aad121d84e43378518cc432f87c9.mp4?t=1752784091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or pilot your COAT, slow moving but with heavy weaponry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/d8b7ba1bb6e0667992aa5fd7c13f8825.poster.avif?t=1752784091\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/d8b7ba1bb6e0667992aa5fd7c13f8825.webm?t=1752784091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/d8b7ba1bb6e0667992aa5fd7c13f8825.mp4?t=1752784091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fight is yours to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/ed81f46fbed8774e0803800674ae022e.avif?t=1752784091\" width=640 height=80 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies carry materials, materials that The Tailors can craft stronger gear from. Choose wisely and upgrade your arsenal, so the enemies of the Stars will not prevail against you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/b4077880a2993a3fbe0d01737fccfaf3.poster.avif?t=1752784091\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/b4077880a2993a3fbe0d01737fccfaf3.webm?t=1752784091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/b4077880a2993a3fbe0d01737fccfaf3.mp4?t=1752784091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/5ffb7adb8a13b7e3b9d392c5e0eef1e2.avif?t=1752784091\" width=640 height=80 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, the Stars do not oppose wanting to look your very best as you take down its enemies. Choose from an assortment of armor and dyes to remind your foes the true beauty of the Stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/ade2117aa08e4d235dc44161d96cfdb1.poster.avif?t=1752784091\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/ade2117aa08e4d235dc44161d96cfdb1.webm?t=1752784091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692030/extras/ade2117aa08e4d235dc44161d96cfdb1.mp4?t=1752784091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
